    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Wonderful World of &quot;Cozy Dash&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this charming top-down adventure, players can choose to play as a cunning snake or a nimble apple, facing off against time and traps in an exciting challenge. Offering both cooperative and competitive gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Players will control a flexible snake chasing a clever apple, avoiding counterattacks while tackling levels filled with traps and enemies.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/206bd530d880345a0e4631e0a6dafa40.poster.avif?t=1741316743\" width=254 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/206bd530d880345a0e4631e0a6dafa40.webm?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/206bd530d880345a0e4631e0a6dafa40.mp4?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Whether playing solo against AI or competing with friends in local multiplayer, endless fun awaits!</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player Mode:</strong> Compete against AI and challenge yourself by playing as either the snake or the apple. Can you outsmart the AI and become the ultimate escape artist?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer Mode:</strong> Team up or compete with friends! Experience the thrill of an intense chase in an exciting head-to-head battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/6d2b56c71a9c66524e5faf122d76de5c.poster.avif?t=1741316743\" width=800 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/6d2b56c71a9c66524e5faf122d76de5c.webm?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/6d2b56c71a9c66524e5faf122d76de5c.mp4?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snake vs. Apple Mode:</strong> A thrilling chase-and-counterattack duel\u2014beware, the apple can strike back with fireballs! Dodge skillfully and claim victory!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Snake Mode:</strong> A modern twist on the classic snake game\u2014colliding with the opponent's tail means defeat. Test your skills against friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode:</strong> The snake and apple join forces to fend off waves of enemies and traps, testing teamwork and survival strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemies and Traps:</strong> Encounter various enemies and avoid hazards such as falling meteors, shooting cannons, and more in each exciting round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups and Boosts:</strong> Collect coins and treasure chests to gain speed boosts, fireball abilities, and other powerful upgrades to change the course of the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Challenge yourself, unlock achievements, and prove you're the ultimate player!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/2f07702bd21c56f5a9f7e95929de3b7f.poster.avif?t=1741316743\" width=552 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/2f07702bd21c56f5a9f7e95929de3b7f.webm?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/2f07702bd21c56f5a9f7e95929de3b7f.mp4?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Gameplay Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Chase System:</strong> The snake must capture the apple while avoiding traps such as meteors and falling rocks. Watch out for cannons that fire projectiles and deadly dead ends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles and Power-ups:</strong> Gather coins scattered across the map to boost your speed and unlock stylish hats in the wardrobe system. Discover treasure chests for extra lives, speed boosts, and temporary fireball abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamina and Sprinting:</strong> Manage your stamina wisely! Sprint to victory, but be careful\u2014strategic energy management is key to outpacing your opponent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Endgame Phase:</strong> In the final 30 seconds, the game speeds up! Both the snake and apple move faster, and the music intensifies, heightening the excitement.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Maps:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different environments, from the lush spring meadows to the scorching summer heat and the warm autumn sun. Each map offers a unique experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outfit System:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can purchase and freely change their character's hats using in-game currency. Each hat features a unique and adorable design, allowing players to mix and match to create their own personalized look, adding fun and creativity to the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/3b2bb5fbd14f271e3d0f666e94c26138.poster.avif?t=1741316743\" width=678 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/3b2bb5fbd14f271e3d0f666e94c26138.webm?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/3b2bb5fbd14f271e3d0f666e94c26138.mp4?t=1741316743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon System:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can purchase and freely switch weapons for their characters using gold. Each weapon comes with unique skills, such as fireballs, bombs, plasma, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can mix and match these weapons during gameplay to create their own custom loadouts, enjoying the fun and creativity that comes with switching gear.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277670/extras/7ba7b8f730310025f7a82d69505d06f3.avif?t=1741316743\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span><strong><br>Controls:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supports controller gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports local multiplayer on the same keyboard</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Settings:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels allow players to customize the experience, extending playtime or increasing the challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Types:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter adorable yet challenging enemies such as slimes, squirrels, and turtles\u2014each with unique attack patterns that add variety to every match.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fun in <strong>&quot;Cozy Dash&quot;</strong>\u2014every match is a heart-pounding pursuit! Will you be the snake that captures the apple, or the apple that outsmarts the snake and claims victory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready for the ultimate showdown! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><i>A special thanks to my dear friend <strong>Robin Lyu</strong> for crafting an amazing trailer for me! Your creativity and dedication have brought the game to life in a truly unique way, and I sincerely appreciate all your hard work!</i></p>",
